{\b\fs24 Winampify}\par
A classic-style desktop music player for your Spotify account.\par
\par
{\b Unofficial software}\par
Winampify is an unofficial, fan-made project for personal use. It is not made, endorsed or supported by Spotify or by Winamp. "Spotify" and "Winamp" are trademarks of their respective owners.\par
\par
{\b What you need}\par
- A Spotify Premium account.\par
- Your own Spotify developer app (Client ID) with the Redirect URI http://127.0.0.1:8888/\par
\par
{\b Good to know}\par
- Installs for your Windows user only, in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\Winampify (no administrator rights needed).\par
- Your login and settings are stored on this PC only, in %APPDATA%\\winampify. Uninstalling Winampify leaves them in place.\par
- The visualizers analyse your PC's sound output locally; nothing is recorded or sent anywhere.\par
\par
{\b Open-source parts}\par
Electron (castLabs build with Widevine, MIT), Butterchurn and Butterchurn presets (MIT). Lyrics from LRCLIB, artist info from MusicBrainz and Wikipedia.\par
\par
This software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind.\par
